    {
      "class_name": "codo.controllers.LobbyController",
      "source_change": [
        "Added the private method `beginDeferredLocalHost(startPara, action)`: refuses (p2p_cancel_start path) when the V2 context is malformed; in protocols 1/2 sends `p2p_start_intent <action> <map> <context>`, in protocol 0 sends `p2p_room <map> <context>` (plus `p2p_localhost 1` for an owned story room); records the selection, room key and context; sets the pending action to \"launch\"; starts the 250 ms timer; then applies Ready or requests START_MATCH immediately.",
        "`onChangeReadyStateHandle`: the early pending-attempt cancel now excludes the pending action \"launch\"; the local branch calls beginCampaignLocalHost(null,true,\"ready\") only when isProductionLocalRoom() and beginDeferredLocalHost(null,\"ready\") otherwise.",
        "`onStartMatchHandle`: the local branch calls beginCampaignLocalHost(myPara,true) only when isProductionLocalRoom() and beginDeferredLocalHost(myPara,\"start\") otherwise.",
        "`onCampaignHostReady`: a new leading block for the pending action \"launch\" (cancel on a changed room/owner/map/context/leave/disable; on ui_p2p_state failed or a non-transient ui_p2p_error cancel, take Ready back if set and show the message; end the watch when ui_p2p_ready is 1 or after 600000 ms). The previous body follows it unchanged and is reached only for the pending actions ready/start, which only beginCampaignLocalHost sets.",
        "`beginCampaignLocalHost`, `isProductionLocalRoom`, `cancelCampaignHostStart`, `completeCampaignHostWait`, `localHostContext`, the room-entry auto-enable and `bind_onRoomLeft` have no source change."
      ],
